{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>WISHLIST NOW COMRADE, THATS AN ORDER!!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Propaganda vs. Zombies</strong> is a bullet heaven deck builder IDLER! Your Propaganda Leader will defend your Honor and recruit allies to fight zombies on its own! All you have to do is watch and (if you want) customize your deck / choose your upgrades to survive longer and conquer all regions!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437850/extras/f578cbef7dd89f6b8daf3a807acc4abd.poster.avif?t=1773682812\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437850/extras/f578cbef7dd89f6b8daf3a807acc4abd.webm?t=1773682812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437850/extras/f578cbef7dd89f6b8daf3a807acc4abd.mp4?t=1773682812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Idler with strategic choices</strong>: Choose and curate cards to shoot, zap, and crush the zombie menace before they overrun your borders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Summon Comrades</strong>: Use Propaganda Bullets (trademark pending) to convert zombies into Comrades that will spread the good word of our nation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Strategic Deckbuilding:\u00a0</strong>Build a deck to suit your playstyle. Whether you prefer overwhelming firepower, cunning spell combos, or comrade-based tactics, there\u2019s always a new strategy to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437850/extras/cfc6c1d23029b81de2eaba5e6865f21a.poster.avif?t=1773682812\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437850/extras/cfc6c1d23029b81de2eaba5e6865f21a.webm?t=1773682812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Choose Your Upgrade Path</strong>: Make critical resource choices that open new opportunities or impose new challenges. These decisions affect your progression and can completely alter how each run unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437850/extras/154d2bf8d156d1179a34785834c1b760.poster.avif?t=1773682812\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437850/extras/154d2bf8d156d1179a34785834c1b760.webm?t=1773682812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437850/extras/154d2bf8d156d1179a34785834c1b760.mp4?t=1773682812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you answer the call to defend Hibura, or will the zombie hordes consume your country\u2019s hopes of a bright red future? Join the revolution\u2014<strong>Propaganda vs. Zombies</strong> awaits!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3437850?t=1773682812","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437850/4cdb71ba9fb053ddece6a5d461a1a6047bf18ef8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773682812","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437850/0f862cdde26b0ca866bbddbd03100c90b78d0a10/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773682812","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it