. Whether you prefer overwhelming firepower, cunning spell combos, or comrade-based tactics, there\u2019s always a new strategy to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437850/extras/cfc6c1d23029b81de2eaba5e6865f21a.poster.avif?t=1773682812\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437850/extras/cfc6c1d23029b81de2eaba5e6865f21a.webm?t=1773682812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Choose Your Upgrade Path</strong>: Make critical resource choices that open new opportunities or impose new challenges. These decisions affect your progression and can completely alter how each run unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437850/extras/154d2bf8d156d1179a34785834c1b760.poster.avif?t=1773682812\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437850/extras/154d2bf8d156d1179a34785834c1b760.webm?t=1773682812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437850/extras/154d2bf8d156d1179a34785834c1b760.mp4?t=1773682812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you answer the call to defend Hibura, or will the zombie hordes consume your country\u2019s hopes of a bright red future? Join the revolution\u2014<strong>Propaganda vs. Zombies</strong> awaits!</p>","developers":["Loboz"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image"